{"step_index":400,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T06:15:09Z","thinking":"**Initiating CSS Updates**\n\nI'm focusing on CSS modifications. My current plan is to use `replace_file_content` to update `public/css/styles.css`. This update involves replacing the existing `.app-footer` styling with `.footer-top-row`, `.footer-module-title`, `.module-code-badge`, `.footer-members-grid`, `.member-chip`, `.member-name`, and `.member-reg`. I'm ready to execute the `replace_file_content` command.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Update application footer CSS styles to format group members grid and module title badge","EndLine":1345,"Instruction":"Add styles for footer-top-row, footer-module-title, module-code-badge, footer-members-grid, member-chip, member-name, and member-reg","ReplacementContent":"/* Application Footer */\n.app-footer {\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;\n    margin-top: auto;\n}\n\n.footer-container {\n    max-width: 1240px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 1.25rem;\n}\n\n.footer-top-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 1rem;\n    padding-bottom: 1rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n}\n\n.footer-brand {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.footer-module-title {\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.module-code-badge {\n    background-color: var(--accent-red-subtle);\n    color: var(--accent-red);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.4);\n    padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n}\n\n.footer-members-grid {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 0.65rem;\n    align-items: center;\n}\n\n.member-chip {\n    background-color: var(--bg-elevated);\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    padding: 0.4rem 0.85rem;\n    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n    font-size: 0.825rem;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.45rem;\n    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.member-chip:hover {\n    border-color: rgba(229, 9, 20, 0.4);\n}\n\n.member-name {\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.member-reg {\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-family: monospace;\n    font-size: 0.775rem;\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n    padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n}\n\n.footer-disclaimer {\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: 0.775rem;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n}","StartLine":1318,"TargetContent":"/* Application Footer */\n.app-footer {\n    background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    padding: 1.5rem;\n    margin-top: auto;\n}\n\n.footer-container {\n    max-width: 1240px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.footer-brand {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    color: var(--text-primary);\n}\n\n.footer-disclaimer {\n    color: var(--text-muted);\n    font-size: 0.775rem;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n}","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\dell\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457\\public\\css\\styles.css","toolAction":"Editing styles.css footer styles","toolSummary":"Editing styles.css footer styles"}}]}
